{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/efcore/pulls/38581","id":4018555702,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAPaMMs7vhks2","html_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/efcore/pull/38581","diff_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/efcore/pull/38581.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/efcore/pull/38581.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/efcore/issues/38581","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/efcore/pulls/38581/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/efcore/pulls/38581/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/efcore/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/efcore/issues/38581/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/efcore/statuses/487390a2e0a55665b493c5aa3bd1cb26b8a0fc1d","number":38581,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Avoid false circular dependency edges for unchanged unique index values during update batching","user":{"login":"Copilot","id":198982749,"node_id":"BOT_kgDOC9w8XQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/1143301?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/copilot-swe-agent","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"The reported failure is a false circular-dependency detection when saving multiple entities that use a unique, store-generated clustering key alongside a composite key. In this shape, update command ordering treated unchanged unique-index values as conflicting dependencies and produced a cycle.\n\n- **Update pipeline: narrow unique-index edge creation**\n  - In `CommandBatchPreparer.AddUniqueValueEdges`, unique-index predecessor edges are now skipped for `Modified` commands when the index value is unchanged between original and current values.\n  - This preserves ordering for real unique-value transitions while removing synthetic cycles from placeholder/store-generated values.\n\n- **Regression coverage for composite key + generated unique index**\n  - Added a targeted test in `CommandBatchPreparerTest` that models:\n    - composite PK (`TestId`, enum category),\n    - store-generated unique clustering key,\n    - multiple modified rows where clustering key remains unchanged.\n  - The scenario now batches without triggering circular dependency detection.\n\n- **Illustrative change**\n  ```csharp\n  // Before adding unique-index dependency edges for Modified commands:\n  var (originalValue, _) = rowIndexValueFactory.CreateEquatableIndexValue(command, fromOriginalValues: true);\n  var (currentValue, _) = rowIndexValueFactory.CreateEquatableIndexValue(command);\n\n  if (Equals(originalValue, currentValue))\n  {\n      continue; // unchanged unique index value: no ordering edge\n  }\n  ```","labels":[],"milestone":{"id":16530471,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAPaMMs4A_Dwn","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/efcore/milestones/232","html_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/efcore/milestone/232","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/efcore/milestones/232/labels","number":232,"state":"open","title":"11.0-preview7","description":null,"creator":{"login":"dotnet-milestone-bot[bot]","id":286398033,"node_id":"BOT_kgDOERIWUQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9141961?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dotnet-milestone-bo